{"id": "78c0376e-048c-4586-aea1-47f12e2b04d2", "role": "assistant", "block_type": "thinking", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I'm noting the cloudtrail-coverage-auditor skill explicitly excludes cost/billing questions, so that's not the right tool here. This looks more like a cost-spike investigation needing Cost Explorer and trail/data-event analysis rather than an operational incident.

I'll treat this as a shallow delegation case, planning to preload investigating-infrastructure-changes and use Cost Explorer via use_aws to compare this partial month against October.

