Now I'm digging into the cost spikes around Oct 29-Nov 3 (~$4/day) and Nov 5 ($10), estimating that translates to roughly 200k paid events/day versus a 2k baseline. I want to sample CloudTrail events from those spike days, aggregating by event source and username in small time windows, to figure out what's generating the burst in activity.

